flowchart LR
  root[Root: canonical lease and owned group] --> supervisor[Process supervisor]
  supervisor --> author[Unchanged original author program]
  supervisor --> client[Unchanged environment client]
  author -->|exit and optional saved artifact| grace[Wait for client natural exit: at most5s]
  client --> grace
  grace -->|still live| signals[SIGINT20s then TERM10s then KILL10s]
  grace -->|client0 and author0| completed[Completed process receipt; checkpoint unaccepted]
  signals --> classify[Record actual exits and cleanup]
  classify -->|client nonzero or escalation| failed[Failed receipt; retain author artifact]
  completed -. root-owned step .-> inspect[Independent artifact and resource acceptance]
  failed -. explicit separate recovery decision .-> inspect
